{"5029720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ʘmʘchim", "steam_appid": 5029720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Whatever the goal, you decide the solution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/83c6ef8501b680164e4b13b321f34aef.poster.avif?t=1787214488\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/83c6ef8501b680164e4b13b321f34aef.webm?t=1787214488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/83c6ef8501b680164e4b13b321f34aef.mp4?t=1787214488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross a river, win a race, save the city: the goals are simple. Getting there isn't. Bolt everyday objects together into contraptions that run on physics. Build a boat. Or just jump over it. Nothing here has one correct answer, and the good ones are rarely the obvious one.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet OmOchim, Your Little Mech</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/3d9f21757fc29bac9aec97e8eaad0dc9.poster.avif?t=1787214488\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/3d9f21757fc29bac9aec97e8eaad0dc9.webm?t=1787214488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/3d9f21757fc29bac9aec97e8eaad0dc9.mp4?t=1787214488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OmOchim is your palm-sized mech companion. Bolt on six wheels, strap some jets to its back, drive it straight into danger, there is no stopping it! No matter how many times you blow it to smithereens, you can always put it back together and try something different.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everything Runs on Real Physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/eadfc76fe3e9112fc46bbb5640afa62c.poster.avif?t=1787214488\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/eadfc76fe3e9112fc46bbb5640afa62c.webm?t=1787214488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/eadfc76fe3e9112fc46bbb5640afa62c.mp4?t=1787214488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather steel balls with a magnet. Float your way across the sea. Move a boulder you could never budge by hand, using nothing but a lever. Every object in this world runs on the same simulation, so run the experiments you'd never get to try in real life, as many times as you like.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Program It to Run Itself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/9bcf1d321b8141045e5f45edb6a7164a.poster.avif?t=1787214488\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/9bcf1d321b8141045e5f45edb6a7164a.webm?t=1787214488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/9bcf1d321b8141045e5f45edb6a7164a.mp4?t=1787214488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When bolting parts together stops being enough, start programming. Drones that fly their own patrol routes. Tanks that aim and fire. A working arcade cabinet. Cast a few OmOchim as actors and shoot your own short film. It's visual programming: snap instruction blocks together, without writing a single line of code. Even with no prior coding experience, you'll have something up and running in minutes. Watching a machine you built carry out orders you wrote never gets old.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Own Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/a9ac8599b514dfb1d30338d8344d2b17.poster.avif?t=1787214488\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/a9ac8599b514dfb1d30338d8344d2b17.webm?t=1787214488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/a9ac8599b514dfb1d30338d8344d2b17.mp4?t=1787214488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Park Builder hands you the whole stage: the course, the traps, the finish line. Make something to race through, something to knock down, or something a little mean, just to make people work for it. Then put your park out there and let players around the world take it on. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who Built the Best Mech?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/014f3d8e3f82ee3bb82bbc3a5a7fe514.poster.avif?t=1787214488\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/014f3d8e3f82ee3bb82bbc3a5a7fe514.webm?t=1787214488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/014f3d8e3f82ee3bb82bbc3a5a7fe514.mp4?t=1787214488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your own OmOchim and put it up against your friends'. Compete on speed, on raw power, on how long it stays in one piece, or on sheer ridiculousness. Shove them off the edge, or roll in with something so stupid that nobody can keep a straight face. How you win is up to you. </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Whatever the goal, you decide the solution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/83c6ef8501b680164e4b13b321f34aef.poster.avif?t=1787214488\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/83c6ef8501b680164e4b13b321f34aef.webm?t=1787214488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/83c6ef8501b680164e4b13b321f34aef.mp4?t=1787214488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross a river, win a race, save the city: the goals are simple. Getting there isn't. Bolt everyday objects together into contraptions that run on physics. Build a boat. Or just jump over it. Nothing here has one correct answer, and the good ones are rarely the obvious one.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet OmOchim, Your Little Mech</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/3d9f21757fc29bac9aec97e8eaad0dc9.poster.avif?t=1787214488\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/3d9f21757fc29bac9aec97e8eaad0dc9.webm?t=1787214488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/3d9f21757fc29bac9aec97e8eaad0dc9.mp4?t=1787214488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OmOchim is your palm-sized mech companion. Bolt on six wheels, strap some jets to its back, drive it straight into danger, there is no stopping it! No matter how many times you blow it to smithereens, you can always put it back together and try something different.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everything Runs on Real Physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/eadfc76fe3e9112fc46bbb5640afa62c.poster.avif?t=1787214488\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/eadfc76fe3e9112fc46bbb5640afa62c.webm?t=1787214488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/eadfc76fe3e9112fc46bbb5640afa62c.mp4?t=1787214488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather steel balls with a magnet. Float your way across the sea. Move a boulder you could never budge by hand, using nothing but a lever. Every object in this world runs on the same simulation, so run the experiments you'd never get to try in real life, as many times as you like.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Program It to Run Itself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/9bcf1d321b8141045e5f45edb6a7164a.poster.avif?t=1787214488\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/9bcf1d321b8141045e5f45edb6a7164a.webm?t=1787214488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/9bcf1d321b8141045e5f45edb6a7164a.mp4?t=1787214488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When bolting parts together stops being enough, start programming. Drones that fly their own patrol routes. Tanks that aim and fire. A working arcade cabinet. Cast a few OmOchim as actors and shoot your own short film. It's visual programming: snap instruction blocks together, without writing a single line of code. Even with no prior coding experience, you'll have something up and running in minutes. Watching a machine you built carry out orders you wrote never gets old.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Own Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/a9ac8599b514dfb1d30338d8344d2b17.poster.avif?t=1787214488\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/a9ac8599b514dfb1d30338d8344d2b17.webm?t=1787214488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/a9ac8599b514dfb1d30338d8344d2b17.mp4?t=1787214488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Park Builder hands you the whole stage: the course, the traps, the finish line. Make something to race through, something to knock down, or something a little mean, just to make people work for it. Then put your park out there and let players around the world take it on. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who Built the Best Mech?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/014f3d8e3f82ee3bb82bbc3a5a7fe514.poster.avif?t=1787214488\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/014f3d8e3f82ee3bb82bbc3a5a7fe514.webm?t=1787214488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/extras/014f3d8e3f82ee3bb82bbc3a5a7fe514.mp4?t=1787214488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your own OmOchim and put it up against your friends'. Compete on speed, on raw power, on how long it stays in one piece, or on sheer ridiculousness. Shove them off the edge, or roll in with something so stupid that nobody can keep a straight face. How you win is up to you. </p>", "short_description": "Build machines, contraptions and playgrounds out of everyday objects in a physics sandbox driven by visual programming. Overcome obstacles, save the city, create worlds. Every goal has a dozen answers. Every crash, collapse and explosion is just the next idea.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/8e0de84fc9b06197ea6dd98a6c59015da07bba17/header.jpg?t=1787214488", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/953b2fe95e6f8083c10871fcd75ede6fb2d8756a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787214488", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5029720/953b2fe95e6f8083c10871fcd75ede6fb2d8756a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787214488", "website": "https://www.omochim.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> N